Implement the validated CIX Sky1 ACPI thermal power model, aggregate one CPU
power actor per CPPC policy, and fail closed when firmware telemetry or a
restarted policy no longer satisfies the cached contract.  Keep the generic
power allocator usable when an individual actor sample fails.

